  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:380px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Deepskyblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Charged Particle Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a1/Raiden_particle_absorption_part_4.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20121110185238\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Raiden particle absorption part 4\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a1/Raiden_particle_absorption_part_4.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20121110185238\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a1/Raiden_particle_absorption_part_4.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20121110185238 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a1/Raiden_particle_absorption_part_4.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20121110185238 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Raiden particle absorption part 4\" width=\"270\" height=\"118\" data-image-key=\"Raiden_particle_absorption_part_4.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Raiden particle absorption part 4.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Raiden (Mortal Kombat: Deception) is capable of absorbing charged particles from all matter to energize his attacks.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability To:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">absorb charged particles</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb all charged particles from the surroundings.</b> Techniques of <a href=\"/wiki/Charged_Particles_Manipulation\" title=\"Charged Particles Manipulation\">Charged Particles Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Items\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Items</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharged_Particle_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Particle Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharged_Particle_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user is capable of imbibing charged particles found in all matter and energy in their body from the environment. With the absorbed particles inhabiting within one's body they might think to release it but in the form of a well constructed attack maybe like a blast or use the particles to add to their mass, or to control their density or increase in size.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharged_Particle_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Condition\">Absolute Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Absorption\" title=\"Electricity Absorption\">Electricity Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Generation\" title=\"Electricity Generation\">Electricity Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Absorption\" title=\"Electromagnetic Absorption\">Electromagnetic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Generation\" title=\"Energy Generation\">Energy Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Beam_Emission\" title=\"Energy Beam Emission\">Energy Beam Emission</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Absorption\" title=\"Ionic Absorption\">Ionic Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Absorption\" title=\"Plasma Absorption\">Plasma Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Generation\" title=\"Ionic Generation\">Ionic Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Generation\" title=\"Plasma Generation\">Plasma Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Scalar_Wave_Generation\" title=\"Scalar Wave Generation\">Scalar Wave Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Generation\" title=\"Electromagnetism Generation\">Electromagnetism Generation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Muscle_Mass_Enhancement\" ti